.TH tusize n 0.39.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tusize \- Recursive byte sizes and human-readable formatting (du-like).
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tusize::bytes path
::tclutils::tusize::human n ?-si 0|1?
::tclutils::tusize::entries dir
.fi
